# Implementation plan — Update Templates WAN2 Variable

Steps
1) Discovery & design — identify template discovery helpers and define selector semantics
2) Implement discovery helper (idempotent filter)
3) Implement fetch + parse + diff generator
4) Snapshot export prior to updates
5) Apply updates with controlled batching and retries
6) Implement rollback from snapshots
7) Tests and docs

Safety: default dry-run; require explicit confirmation for destructive runs; create snapshots before updates.
